  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The evidence submitted fails to demonstrate that on the balance of probability the use of Flat 2C, 13A Chatsworth Road fits within the ambit of Class C3 of The Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding reason 1, the evidence submitted fails to demonstrate that on the balance of probability the Flat 2C, 13A Chatsworth Road unit has been occupied continuously for a period of at least 4 years prior to the date of application. The evidence submitted by the applicant is therefore inadequate pursuant to Section 171(B) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990.&lt;/p&gt;"
